Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 23:26:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 27/45] decide: move full-path helpers to decide-fullpath; mode
 assert; +inf test

leaf_merged_sets, full_path_row and the full-path dump entry move
unchanged to tools/decide/decide-fullpath.h/.cpp (no engine types).
The decode entry plumbing (decode_entry, decode_chunks, chunk_rows,
row_ref, add_full_path_seq) and count_branches stay in decide-engine.
run_round rejects a full-path state that does not match the trie
set's scoring mode (500). test-decide-fullpath: a +inf logit makes
every value read from the row NaN and score_field_full rejects it.
